  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;※８．有形固定資産の減価償却累計額&lt;/p&gt;
